{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42559","headline":"怀华山隐者 · 刘昭禹","name":"怀华山隐者","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"先生入太华，杳杳绝良音。\n秋梦有时见，孤云无处寻。\n神清峰顶立，衣冷瀑边吟。\n应笑干名者，六街尘土深。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘昭禹","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_42559.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42559","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}